TerraGo organise des événements d'entreprise immersifs chez des producteurs engagés, partout en France.

Séminaires, réunions, journées d'équipe : vos collaborateurs vivent une expérience réelle au cœur d'une exploitation, aux côtés de producteurs engagés qui partagent leur métier et leur histoire. Récolte, transformation, temps de travail, repas en circuit court : chaque événement soutient directement celles et ceux qui nous accueillent.

Chaque événement, c'est :
 1 - Des temps de travail et de réunion dans un cadre qui change tout, sans rien sacrifier au sérieux ni à la productivité ;
 2 - Des immersions réelles sur le terrain, à la rencontre de producteurs engagés qui partagent leurs histoires, leurs choix et leurs défis concrets du quotidien ;
 2 - Des activité qui ont du sens, avec du challenge ou non : récolter des olives et faire son huile, fabriquer son fromage avec l'éleveuse, tailler, vendanger, etc
 3 - Un modèle qui soutient directement les producteurs qui nous accueillent, rémunérés à la juste valeur de leur temps et de leur savoir-faire ;
 4 - Une logistique pensée pour peser peu : lieux, traiteurs et hébergements choisis en circuit court et en local, sans superflu ;
 5 - Des repas locaux et conviviaux : de grandes tablées généreuse, des repas typiques, de produits en circuit court ; 

Nous croyons qu'un événement d'entreprise réussi n'a pas besoin de grands artifices pour marquer les esprits. Juste un lieu vrai, un producteur qui a une histoire à raconter, des repas conviviaux et généreux, et une équipe prête à mettre les mains dans la terre.

Des expériences qui ont du sens, et un impact concret sur le territoire.

📩  contact@terragoexperiences.fr — parlons de votre prochain événement.

Sathguru Catalyser Advisors Private Limited (SCA) is the investment manager of Innovation in Food & Agriculture Fund (IFA Fund) that invests in Innovation driven growth enterprises in the Food & Agriculture sectors. The fund is sponsored by Sathguru Management Consultant (SMC), a premier consulting organization that has spearheaded business growth across the life sciences spectrum including food and agribusiness over the last three decades. 

IFA Fund is a sector focused  growth fund, investing in Indian enterprises with an aim to support technology driven enterprises by providing the required growth impetus including access to technologies, markets and capital.
Our typical investment preference has the following ingredients:

•	Technology Edge – Transformational technology developed in-house or accessed through licensing;
•	Tech Savvy Leadership - Ability to understand and face genuine risk related to technology, its scale up and regulations;
•	Long Term Orientation - Focus on durable markets for business, rather than short term bubbles

COLLA was founded in 1992 and serves as Authorized Channel Partner in Latvia, Lithuania, Estonia, Central Asia and Caucasus countries for the following software products: 
- CAD/CAM system Mastercam for NC toolpath creation for all types of CNC machines; 
- CIMCO solutions including CNC Editors, DNC software, Manufacturing Data Collection and Manufacturing Data Management; 
- VERISURF – Model-based Inspection & Measurement Software on Mastercam Platform and CMM Hardware;
- CAM Assist from CloudNC - Artificial Intelligence add-on for Mastercam users;
- CAM system Robotmaster for offline programming of industrial robots;
- APlus – add-on software to Mastercam and Robotmaster for Additive Manufacturing.

COLLA delivers perpetual licenses or annual subscriptions, develops postprocessors, including 5-axis, provides customer technical support in the scope of Maintenance, consultations, customers basic and advanced training on software usage. 

Why COLLA, why Mastercam?
Over 30 years of experience working as a Reseller of Mastercam in a region that includes territories of several countries, the presence of competent team and its own network of sub-resellers, targeted marketing, cooperation with OEM resellers of CNC machines, a responsible approach to providing users with high-quality information and technical support, assistance in the development and debugging of post-processors, as well as an individual approach to endusers training, allowed COLLA to become one of the leading suppliers of CAD/CAM systems in the Baltics.

The Department of Fashion Management Studies (FMS) at NIFT Jodhpur focuses on integrating creativity with strategic business thinking. The program nurtures future leaders in fashion, retail, and lifestyle industries through a blend of design awareness, management principles, and real-world exposure.

Our students explore areas like brand management, fashion marketing, retail strategy, and entrepreneurship, fostering a holistic understanding of the fashion ecosystem. Through projects, internships, and collaborations, FMS Jodhpur bridges the gap between design and management to shape tomorrow’s fashion professionals.

{This account is managed by students of the Department of Fashion Management Studies, NIFT Jodhpur.}
